#. Tag: title
#: fitsviewer.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "<acronym>FITS</acronym> Viewer Tool"
msgstr "<acronym>FITS</acronym> Alat za pregledanje"

#. Tag: primary
#: fitsviewer.docbook:3
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Alati"

#. Tag: secondary
#: fitsviewer.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "FITS Viewer"
msgstr "FITS prikazivač"

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Flexible Image Transport System (FITS) is the standard format for "
"representing images and data in Astronomy."
msgstr ""
"Fleksibilni Izražajni Transportni Sistem (FITS)  je standardni format za "
"predstavljanje slike i podataka iz astronomije."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kstars; FITS Viewer tool is integrated with the <link linkend=\"indi"
"\">INDI</link> framework for seamless display and manipulation of captured "
"FITS images. To open a FITS file, select <guimenuitem>Open FITS...</"
"guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>File</guimenu> menu, or press <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"&kstars; FITS Prikazivač alat je ugrađen s <link linkend = \"indi\"> INDI </"
"link> okvir za  manipulaciju i ostale  moguće od  datih FITS slike. Da biste "
"otvorili datoteku moguće učitati, odaberite <guimenuitem>Otvori FITS...</"
"guimenuitem> od <guimenu> Fajl</guimenu> izbornik, ili pritisnite <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo>."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "FITS Viewer features:"
msgstr "FITS Prikazivač karakteristike:"

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "Support for 8, 16, 32, IEEE -32, and IEEE -64 bits formats."
msgstr "Podrska za 8, 16, 32, IEEE -32, i IEEE -64 bitni format."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Histogram with linear, logarithmic, and square-root scales."
msgstr "Histogram s linearnim, logaritamskim, i eksponencijalnim skalama."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "Brightness/Contrast controls."
msgstr "SVijetlina/Kontrast kontrole."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pan and Zoom."
msgstr "Psostavi i zumiraj."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto levels."
msgstr "Automatski nivo."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "Statistics."
msgstr "Statistika."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "FITS header query."
msgstr "FITS upit zaglavlja."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "Undo/Redo."
msgstr "Ponisti/Ponovi."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: fitsviewer.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "The FITS Viewer Tool"
msgstr "FITS Alat za Pregledanje"

#. Tag: phrase
#: fitsviewer.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "FITS Viewer Tool"
msgstr "FITS Alat za Pregledanje"

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The above diagram illustrates the FITS Viewer work area and window. The tool "
"provides basic functions for image display. FITS data depth is preserved "
"throughout all processing, open, and save functions. While the tool adhere "
"to the FITS standard, it does not support all possible FITS features:"
msgstr ""
"Gornji dijagram prikazuje radnu površinu FITS Prglednika i prozor. Alat "
"pruža osnovne funkcije za prikaz slike. FITS podaci su prikazani tokom "
"citave obrade, otvaranja i sasavanja funkcija. Dok alat pridržavati FITS "
"standarda, to ne podržavaju sve moguće moguće FITS mogucnosti :"

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Support for only <emphasis>one</emphasis> image per file."
msgstr "Podrska za samo  <emphasis>jednu </emphasis> sliku po fajlu."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "Support for only 2D data. 1D and 3D data are discarded."
msgstr "Podrska za samo 2D podatke. 1D i 3D podaci su odbaceni."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "No support for WCS (World Coordinate System)."
msgstr "Nema podrsku za WCS (World Coordinate System)."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "The following is a brief description of the tool's functional units:"
msgstr "Slijedi kratak opis od funkcionalnih djelova alata:"

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Histogram: Displays one-channel FITS histogram. The user can rescale the "
"image by optionally defining an upper and lower limit for the cutoff region. "
"The rescaling operation (linear, logarithmic, or square-root) may then be "
"applied to the region enclosed by the upper and lower limits."
msgstr ""
"Histogram: Prikazuje jedan kanal FITS  histogram.Korisnik može promijeniti "
"sliku po želji definira gornju i donju granicu za kritična područja. "
"Promjena operacija  (linearna, logaritamska ili eksponencijalna) može se "
"primijeniti na području u sklopu gornje i donje granice."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Statistics: Provides simple statistics for minimum and maximum pixel values "
"and their respective locations. FITS depth, dimension, mean, and standard "
"deviation."
msgstr ""
"Statistika: Pruža jednostavne statistike za minimalni i maksimalni "
"vrijednosti piksela i njihovim mjestima. FITS dubinu, dimenzije, značenje , "
"i standardnu devijaciju."

#. Tag: para
#: fitsviewer.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "FITS header: Displays FITS header information."
msgstr "FITS zaglavlje : Prikazuje FITS zagljave sa informacijama."
